== Behavior ==
The '''Tarantula Broodfather''' is a Spider-type mob hostile to all players. It has the appearance of a cave spider riding a spider. It is agile, able to move quickly, climb walls and jump huge distances. It deals melee damage. Often, it will change targets to other nearby players.

All '''Tarantula Broodfathers''' are immune to the abilities of [[Aspect of the Dragons]] and [[Ice Spray Wand]].

As with all Slayer bosses, if the '''Tarantula Broodfather''' has not dealt damage to a player for some time, it will begin rapidly regenerating health. The regeneration immediately stops when it hits a player again. Additionally, if either it or its target stays in the same block for too long, it performs a slam-dunk attack, knocking the target towards it and dealing {{Stat|True Damage}}. If 3 minutes pass without the boss being defeated, it will despawn, failing the Slayer quest. A timer is shown above its head indicating the remaining time.

Each tier has all of the abilities from the ones before it. 

=== {{SlayerTier|1}} ===
*'''Backstab''' - The Broodfather will occasionally leap behind the player and inflict {{Red|20%}} more {{Stat|dmg}}.
=== {{SlayerTier|2}} ===
*'''Backstab''' - The Broodfather will occasionally leap behind the player and inflict {{Red|30%}} more {{Stat|dmg}}.
*'''Noxious Paralysis''' - The Broodfather reduces the player's {{Stat|vitality}} & {{Stat|spd}} by {{Red|15%}} and {{Red|10%}} respectively when the boss is alive.
=== {{SlayerTier|3}} ===
*'''Backstab''' - The Broodfather will occasionally leap behind the player and inflict {{Red|40%}} more {{Stat|dmg}}.
*'''Noxious Paralysis''' - The Broodfather reduces the player's {{Stat|vitality}} & {{Stat|spd}} by {{Red|30%}} and {{Red|25%}} respectively when the boss is alive.
*'''Web of Lies''' - Occurs at {{hp|600k}} (66%) & {{hp|300k}} (33%). The Broodfather will leap to a nearby area and begins spewing web to surround itself. While the Web of Lies is ongoing, it disables teleportation magic unless the player breaks {{Gold|2}} Egg Sacs above the boss with {{Green|3}} {{Stat|hp}} per Egg Sac. If the egg sacs hatch, then they spawn {{MobSprite|Primordial Hatchling}}s to attack the player.
=== {{SlayerTier|4}} ===
*'''Backstab''' - The Broodfather will occasionally leap behind the player and inflict {{Red|60%}} more {{Stat|dmg}}.
*'''Noxious Paralysis''' - The Broodfather reduces the player's {{Stat|vitality}} & {{Stat|spd}} by {{Red|50%}} and {{Red|50%}} respectively when the boss is alive.
*'''Web of Lies''' - Occurs at {{hp|1.6M}} (66%) & {{hp|800k}} (33%). The player needs to deal with {{Gold|3}} Egg Sacs above the boss with each Egg Sac having {{Green|6}} {{Stat|hp}}. Failing to break one in time will spawn a {{MobSprite|Primordial Hatchling}}.
*'''Bat Barrage''' - The Broodfather will periodically spawn a horde of {{MobSprite|Primordial Bat}}s to inflict {{Red|0.1%}} of max {{Stat|hp}} as {{Stat|dmg}} while becoming immune to Magic Damage.

=== {{SlayerTier|5}} (Primordial Broodfather) ===
Like the {{MobSprite|Revenant Horror}} {{Stier|5}}, the Broodfather has a natural regeneration effect and immunity to [[Ability Damage]].
*'''Backstab''' - The Broodfather will occasionally leap behind the player and inflict {{Red|80%}} more {{Stat|dmg}}.
*'''Noxious Paralysis''' - The Broodfather reduces the player's {{Stat|vitality}} & {{Stat|spd}} by {{Red|75%}} and {{Red|75%}} respectively when the boss is alive. It also disables {{Stat|Absorption}}  from all sources.
*'''Web of Lies''' - Occurs at {{hp|6.7M}} (66%) & {{hp|3.3M}} (33%). The player must deal with {{Gold|4}} Egg Sacs above the boss with each Egg Sac having {{Green|9}} {{Stat|hp}}. Failing to break one in time will spawn a {{MobSprite|Primordial Minion}}.
*'''Bat Barrage''' - The Broodfather will periodically spawn a horde of {{MobSprite|Primordial Bat}}s to inflict {{Red|0.2%}} of max {{Stat|hp}} as {{Stat|dmg}}.
*'''Till Death Do Us Part''' - Upon killing the Broodfather, it summons the Primordial Broodmother and fuses to become the Conjoined Brood. Its stats doubles that of {{MobSprite|Tarantula Broodfather}} {{Stier|5}} and only retains its passive abilities ('''Backstab''' & '''Noxious Paralysis''').
